  "description": "**Original Novel:**  \n[Chapters](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6240061), [Volumes](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=6611246), [Volumes (Special Bonus)](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=8690609)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9960923)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9960920)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003135)\n\n***Note:** End Up With You is the official english name on the novel cover.*\n\n'Doha, doha. '  \nTen years ago, the last request I repeated while holding Doha, who was stopping.  \nDa-kyung never dreamed that it would cause a situation like today.  \nDoha narrowed the distance and grabbed Dakyung's chin.\n\n“I don’t want to say anything, so open your mouth.“\n\nIron Armoured and Armoured. At the sound of the buckle loosening, Da-kyung nervously wore a lip.\n\n\"You're supposed to be...\" ... Was he like this?  \n“I wasn’t originally like this. How could he even be nicknamed Yoon Da-kyung's dog?\"\n\nThe faintly curved corners of their eyes sank coldly.  \n“But, it became like this because I was discarded after eating.“  \n“…….”  \n“So stop talking about the boring things and open your mouth, Dakyung.“\n\nThe thumb, which was wandering along Da-kyung's lip line, unexpectedly wandered through the gap.\n\n“How much will you kill your mouth in 10 years? I'm curious about the time of the mountain, sir.\"\n\n*\n\nYoon Da-kyung, who suddenly disappeared from Hagok on the night of her 20s.  \nAnd Yoon Da-kyung's dog, Kwon Do-ha, who was a man who found her and went through.\n\nNineteen, the story of two people who are terribly intertwined with each other's lives.",
